  "title": "Amy&#39;s Marvelous Marbled Cheesecake",
  "description": "Delicious marble cheesecake recipe made with chocolate cheesecake swirled in creamy vanilla batter and layered in a crumbly chocolate graham cracker crust.",
  "authors": [
    "Amy"
  ],
